  "description": "A fully managed, cross-platform FFmpeg/FFprobe wrapper for .NET that makes media analysis and conversion easy. Exposes video and audio transcoding, muxing, probing, snapshots and animated GIFs, raw frame piping, a fluent argument builder covering codecs, filters, colour management, metadata and stream dispositions, a built-in process wrapper, and an in-memory image bridge (snapshots as CodeBrix.Imaging images) under the CodeBrix.VideoProcessing namespace.",
